# manifest.json is cryptographically signed (see signing/README.md) — its bytes must always
# match exactly what GitHub serves over raw.githubusercontent.com (LF), regardless of the
# local checkout platform. Without this, Windows' core.autocrlf=true rewrites it to CRLF on
# checkout, silently breaking the signature.
manifest.json text eol=lf
manifest.json.sig text eol=lf
